# BlankPos.exe and RevCloud.exe, deployed into a bin folder under one of
# the PMLLIB search path entries and found there at run time by the
# DrawingPlan1 / DrawingPlan1Revision constructors. ~25MB of PyInstaller
# onefile each, rebuilt every time the Python changes, so they are copied
# to the share by hand rather than carried in the history. built from
# Documents/Python/blankpos and Documents/Python/revcloud.
bin/

# DXF dropped here to be read while working out how DXFOUT lays a drawing
# out. diagnostic only, and a megabyte a time.
*.dxf

# what the E3D machine drops here for a look at a revision run: the
# project log, the RevCloud answer and its log, the vertex list. copies
# of files that live in the project folder and AVEVA_DESIGN_USER.
*_REV.log
RevCloud_*
